      "widgets_values": [
        "Stylized dark-fantasy chibi mage battle short, based on the reference character: a small witch girl with long curly black hair, pale skin, large expressive eyes, a tall black witch hat decorated with purple roses, and a layered black-purple dress. Keep the character design highly consistent with the reference image. Cute proportions, but the battle performance is powerful, dramatic, and confident. Atmosphere mysterious and intense, with purple-black magic effects, smoky shadows, glowing sigils, and a moonlit fantasy battlefield.\n\nTimeline:\n[0s-2s] Medium shot opens on the witch standing in a ruined stone courtyard at night, purple mist drifting across the ground, loose hair and dress edges moving slightly in the wind. She slowly raises her wand or staff, eyes narrowing with confidence. She speaks in Chinese: “想试试我的魔法吗？” A faint purple glow begins to gather in her hand.\n\n[2s-4s] Hard cut to a lower-angle shot. A dark shadow creature or magical enemy lunges into frame from the side. The witch pivots quickly, steps back, and swings her wand in a smooth arc. A crescent-shaped purple spell flashes outward. Her sleeves and dress follow the motion naturally. The first spell impact lands with a bright burst and drifting black particles.\n\n[4s-6.5s] Cut to a side action shot. The witch points forward sharply and casts a second spell with more force, forming layered glowing runes in front of her. She speaks in Chinese with a stronger tone: “黑夜，听从我的召唤！” Multiple purple energy bolts fire in sequence toward the enemy. Each bolt should be clearly synced to her wand movement and hand gesture.\n\n[6.5s-9s] Cut to a closer shot as the enemy attacks back. The witch turns her body, lifts one arm, and creates a circular purple-black shield in front of herself. Sparks, smoke, and magical fragments explode outward on impact. Her face stays focused and slightly fierce. After blocking, she slides one foot back and prepares a stronger finishing spell.\n\n[9s-12s] Dynamic hero shot. The witch spins once, cloak and hair swirling, then plants her feet and lifts the wand overhead. A large magic circle appears beneath her and another behind her back. Energy gathers rapidly, bright purple at the core and darker black-violet smoke around the edges. She speaks in Chinese: “暗影之门，开启吧！” The final spell forms as a concentrated beam or roaring magical blast.\n\n[12s-15s] Final attack lands. The enemy is overwhelmed by the purple-black magic explosion and dissolves into shadow fragments. The witch lands lightly, the magic glow fading around her. She lowers her wand with a confident, slightly smug expression and says in Chinese: “结束了。” Final pose holds for a beat, with drifting purple embers in the air.\n\nCamera:\nCinematic but controlled. Use readable action framing, medium shots, low-angle hero shots, and a few close action beats. Motion should feel energetic but not chaotic. No excessive shaky cam, no overly fast spinning camera, no messy composition. Keep the witch clearly visible at all times and preserve her full costume silhouette.\n\nAction and performance:\nThe witch must move like a spellcaster: wand-led gestures, arm sweeps, finger control, quick pivots, magical blocking, and a strong finishing cast. Hair, hat, sleeves, and layered skirt should react naturally to her movements. Magic timing must match body timing. Her facial expression should evolve from playful confidence to battle focus, then back to calm confidence at the end.\n\nAudio:\nDark fantasy orchestral battle score with low strings, deep drum hits, and rising choir texture. Add magical sound effects precisely synced to each spell cast: energy charging hum, rune activation sparkle, wand swish, shield impact burst, explosion bloom, and shadow-disintegration particles. Background ambience includes night wind and faint battlefield reverb. The Chinese voice should sound like a young witch girl, clear Mandarin, confident and slightly playful, with clean lip-sync matching the spoken lines.\n\nDialogue:\n[0s-2s] “想试试我的魔法吗？”\n[4s-6.5s] “黑夜，听从我的召唤！”\n[9s-12s] “暗影之门，开启吧！”\n[12s-15s] “结束了。”",
        1344,
        768,
        73
      ]
